For ≤ 2-minute audio, single user / few concurrent users, you do NOT need a datacenter GPU.

What VaaniAI actually needs?

        STT (Whisper-like) → GPU heavy
        Translation (HF models) → moderate GPU
        LLM response → can be CPU or small GPU
        TTS → light GPU or CPU


What are the Target GPU capabilities
      6–12 GB VRAM is enough
      CUDA support
      Good FP16 performance
      Low power


BIOS setting (IMPORTANT)
    
    PCIe Slot Speed → Gen3 (manual)
    Above 4G Decoding → Enabled

Expected performance for VaaniAI

        With RTX 3060 (12 GB):
                Whisper-medium:   → ~5–8× faster than CPU
                Translation models: near-instant
                TTS: realtime
                End-to-end latency (1 min audio): → <10–15 seconds total


